  "_prose_key_comment": "Each scenario names its write-up with \"prose\", a file in docs/prose/scenarios/ -- one file per scenario. The truncation and low-polarization scenarios are written separately for Basic and for the City Charter proposal, since each describes the configuration it was derived from. Two scenarios may still share a file by naming it twice; omit the key and a scenario falls back to <slug>.md.",
  "_variant_comment": "A scenario may declare \"variants\": [{\"id\", \"label\"}, ...] and tag each of its systems with one. The page renders them as a toggle beside Bloc model, carrying the current contest across, so the same election under two simulation settings is one selection rather than two dropdown entries. Variants whose runs have no results yet are dropped at build time; the toggle appears once at least two resolve."
